<h1>Thames Path SWC-Walk-L10 #swcwalks COPYRIGHT 2025 SATURDAY WALKERS CLUB ANDREW MURPHY ALL RIGHTS RESERVED WWW.WALKINGCLUB.ORG.UK </h1>
<p>The Thames towpath from quiet rural stream, via Oxford, Windsor and surburbia to Central London and the Thames Barrier.</p><p>This route was created by the Saturday Walkers Club. It is fully written up at <a href="https://www.walkingclub.org.uk/long-distance-path/thames-path/">https://www.walkingclub.org.uk/long-distance-path/thames-path/</a> #swcwalks</p><p> COPYRIGHT 2025 SATURDAY WALKERS CLUB ANDREW MURPHY ALL RIGHTS RESERVED WWW.WALKINGCLUB.ORG.UK </p>
